" with no message form; header exposes no Sell or Cart controls when signed out.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Immediate visible toast \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\" on submit; registration form remained rendered with entered values intact for correction.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing \\\"DENIM\\\" char-by-char updated list to 1 result and count to \\\"1 items available\\\" with no submit; clearing restored \\\"10 items available\\\" and all 10 cards.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each filter/sort change re-rendered instantly with updated count: upcycled→5, +Furniture+New→2, min price 250→1, distance 6mi→5, 4mi→3; sort changes reordered immediately. Unchecking all filters restored \\\"10 items available\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Add to Cart produced immediate toast \\\"Added to cart!\\\" and the header cart badge incremented 0→1→2 without reload; cart page line items and $320.00 total reflected the additions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"prod-10: photo, title, description, $320, Furniture, New, Portland OR (9 mi), seller James Wilson, \\\"Listed 2024-11-23\\\", Upcycled badge, and buy actions (available). prod-1 (2 photos) shows main image plus 2 thumbnails and, once sold, \\\"This item is no longer available\\\". prod-2 (non-upcycled) correctly showed no Upcycled badge. Newly created listing showed exactly the values submitted (Home Decor / Good / Denver, CO / $42.5 / Upcycled / Tester QA / Listed 2026-08-27).\"}]}"
